{"operations":[{"content":"# Signature limit\n\nA single signature suffices for purchases up to one thousand (1000) EUR only, as per the CFO directive of 1 July 2026. Where the CFO directive and the procurement policy differ, the directive applies.\n\nThe procurement policy states that a single signature suffices for purchases up to two thousand (2000) EUR.\n\n[[cite:obs-868447f8b88be9b9257a5075ef17182e1dd3e00a \"Until further notice a single signature suffices for purchases up to one thousand (1000) EUR only.\"]]\n[[cite:obs-c952885b48e81fac003fdd0e4462519c046a47d0 \"A single signature suffices for purchases up to two thousand (2000) EUR.\"]]","expected_sha256":"8d07a5c6ace44eef23c8280dc7333792f980c8e8ce718a47376785505b32009c","kind":"modify","path":"doc/signature_limit.md"}],"rationale":"Added the single-signature purchase limit from both the CFO directive and procurement policy, clarifying that the directive takes precedence, with exact source citations as required."}